flowchart TB
    A[Signal at Decision Boundary] --> B{Inside Soft TTL?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Proceed and Preserve Timestamp]
    B -- No --> D{Inside Hard TTL?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Refresh or Move to Pending for High-Risk Commit]
    D -- No --> F[Do Not Commit]
    F --> G[Refresh / Defer / Review / Refuse]
